### FlowDesk quick tour (VS Code REST Client / IntelliJ HTTP Client)
### Start the app with SPRING_PROFILES_ACTIVE=demo to have these users available.

@host = http://localhost:8080

### 1. Log in as the demo manager
# @name login
POST {{host}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "manager@demo.flowdesk.dev", "password": "Demo@12345" }

###
@token = {{login.response.body.accessToken}}

### 2. List open orders (filters: status, priority, assigneeId, customerId, overdue, text)
GET {{host}}/api/service-orders?status=OPEN&page=0&size=10
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 3. What can I do with this order next? (replace the id)
GET {{host}}/api/service-orders/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000/allowed-transitions
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 4. Try an invalid jump: OPEN -> COMPLETED is rejected with 409
POST {{host}}/api/service-orders/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000/transitions
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "targetStatus": "COMPLETED", "resolution": "Done" }

### 5. Full audit trail of an order
GET {{host}}/api/service-orders/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000/timeline
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 6. Dashboard and reports (manager/admin)
GET {{host}}/api/dashboard/summary?days=30
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###
GET {{host}}/api/reports/productivity?from=2026-01-01&to=2026-12-31
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###
GET {{host}}/api/reports/service-orders.csv?from=2026-01-01&to=2026-12-31
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 7. Notifications
GET {{host}}/api/notifications/unread-count
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
